[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（昼休みだし、リフレッシュしとかなくちゃな！\r\n……お、あのラーメン屋なんか美味しそうだ）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bg": "00003",
    "bgm": "002",
    "se": "0120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004010010,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "……大変大変！　このままじゃ遅れちゃうよー！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0118",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300401/2003004010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ん？　なんだ……\r\nって、うわぁ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0108",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004010020,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "きゃあっ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300401/2003004010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いてて……すいません、大丈夫でしたか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004010030,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ううん！　わたしの方こそごめんなさい……\r\n……って、プロデューサー！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1040030010",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200300401/2003004010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004010040,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "こんなところで会うなんて偶然だね！\r\n何してたの？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300401/2003004010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんだ、めぐるだったのか\r\n俺は気晴らしに街に出てただけだよ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それよりめぐるこそ、そんなに急いでどうしたんだ？",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004010050,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うん！　わたしはね、助っ人に呼ばれて、\r\nこれから行くところ……",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300401/2003004010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004010060,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あー！　そうだった！　このままじゃ遅刻しちゃう！\r\nわたし、行かなくちゃ！　じゃあね、プロデューサー！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0118",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "x": 200,
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 450
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200300401/2003004010060"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "movie": "1040030010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっ、おい、めぐる！　……行っちゃった\r\n……せっかくだからめぐるの活躍ぶりでも見に行くか！",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bg": "00013",
    "se": "0118",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はぁ、はぁ……めぐるのやつ、さすがの速さだな……\r\n今どこに――あそこか。バスケの試合みたいだけど……",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004010070,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "こっちこっちー！\r\nパス、パス！",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0101",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "x": -200,
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 700
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200300401/2003004010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うーん、やっぱりめぐるの動きはすごいな……",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004010080,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "行くよー！\r\n……えいっ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300401/2003004010080"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0102",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……おっ、ナイスシュートだな\r\nあれで逆転だ！",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "effectLabel": "black1",
    "effectTarget": {
      "type": "rect",
      "width": 1136,
      "height": 640,
      "color": "000000"
    },
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "from",
      "x": 1000,
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 1000
    },
    "waitType": "effect"
  },
  {
    "effectLabel": "black1",
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 1000,
      "easing": "easeInQuart"
    },
    "waitType": "effect"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……試合終了か。さすがはめぐる、あっと言う間に\r\nひっくり返したな",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004010090,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "プッロデューサー！",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200300401/2003004010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うおっ！　め、めぐるか……",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004010100,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えへへ！　試合中にプロデューサーが見えたから、\r\n終わったら絶対に話しかけようって思ってたんだ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300401/2003004010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004010110,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "お昼休みなのに、見に来てくれたんだよね？\r\nありがとう！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300401/2003004010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "特に予定も無かったしな\r\nめぐるの活躍するところを見てみたかったし",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それにしても、見てて惚れ惚れするような\r\nすごい活躍だったぞ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004010120,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えへへ！　そうかな？　そうかなー！？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300401/2003004010120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。それに、楽しそうにプレーしてるのが\r\n外から見ていても分かったよ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004010130,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "だって、みんなと身体を動かせるとすっごく楽しいもん！\r\nそれに今日は、プロデューサーも見ててくれてたしね！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300401/2003004010130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004010140,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……そうだ！\r\n今度は事務所のみんなも見に来てくれないかなぁ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300401/2003004010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "みんなで応援に行けたら楽しそうだな\r\nなんとかスケジュールの都合をつけてみるよ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004010150,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ホント！？　\r\nじゃあじゃあ、今度の水泳大会がいいかな！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300401/2003004010150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004010160,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "それとも、次の週にあるバスケの練習試合がいいかな～\r\nあ、でも、陸上の試合も見に来てくれると……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300401/2003004010160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ちょ、ちょっと待ってくれ、めぐる",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "さすがにそんなにたくさんは、\r\n全員のスケジュールを合わせられないよ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004010170,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あっ、そっか……\r\nそうだよね！　みんなもお仕事、あるもんね",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300401/2003004010170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……えーと、俺だけで良ければ、だけど、\r\n見に行こうか？",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004010180,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "いいの！?\r\n……あ、でもプロデューサーも忙しいし……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300401/2003004010180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺だけなら都合もつけやすいから、大丈夫だよ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004010190,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "本当にっ！?　やったー！\r\nじゃあ今度の試合、見に来てくれたら嬉しいな！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300401/2003004010190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004010200,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "プロデューサーが来るなら、楽しんでもらわなきゃだよね！\r\nわたし、いつもより頑張るから！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300401/2003004010200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（めぐるがこれだけ喜んでるんだ\r\nなんとかスケジュールを調整して見に行かなくちゃな！）",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]